  "content": "Cole had 10 three-putts in his last 5 rounds, an average of 33 putts per round. Both figures cover all 5 rounds, from Sep 30 to Oct 21.\n\nThe three-putts came in two clusters. Two of the three tournament rounds on Oct 21 at Springfield Country Club had 37 putts and 3 three-putts each. The other 3 rounds had 31 putts or fewer, with 0 to 2 three-putts.\n\n- Oct 21, tournament, 73 (+1): 30 putts, 0 three-putts\n- Oct 21, tournament, 77 (+5): 37 putts, 3 three-putts\n- Oct 21, tournament, 74 (+2): 37 putts, 3 three-putts\n- Oct 6, practice at Bryan Park Champs, 82 (+10): 31 putts, 2 three-putts\n- Sep 30, practice at Starmount Forest, 75 (+4): 30 putts, 2 three-putts\n\nThe two high-putt tournament rounds line up with his putting strokes gained. It was -6.64 in the 77 and -3.90 in the 74. In the 73 it was -0.90. His three tournament rounds averaged 34.67 putts.\n\nThe three Oct 21 rounds are logged on one date, so they may be separate rounds that day. I haven't checked how they were played.",
